<title>PHILIPPINES: Rizal Bank says 1996 net slightly down.</title>
<headline>Rizal Bank says 1996 net slightly down.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year 1996</p>
<p>		  (in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		    1,166   vs   1,402</p>
<p>    Operating income	    8,064   vs   6,717</p>
<p>    Total interest income     6,969   vs   5,644</p>
<p>    Total interest expenses   4,232   vs   3,415</p>
<p>Note: Rizal Commercial Banking Corp is a commercial bank.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (632) 841 8914</p>
</text>
